sequenceDiagram
    actor Founder
    participant Edge as Edge Voice Node
    participant Speech as Speech Adapter
    participant Voice as Voice Orchestrator
    participant Insight as Insight Decision Service
    participant State as Business State Service
    participant Control as Control Plane Service
    participant MCP as Seleric MCP

    Founder->>Edge: Wake word + utterance
    Edge->>Speech: Audio after local activation
    Speech-->>Edge: Transcript + confidence
    Edge->>Voice: VoiceTurnCommand + auth + trace
    Voice->>Voice: Classify bounded intent + resolve references
    alt Low confidence
        Voice-->>Edge: Repeat/clarify response
    else Supported intent
        Voice->>Insight: Typed executive query
        Insight->>Control: Runtime bundle if cache miss
        Insight->>State: Latest state/health snapshot
        alt Snapshot valid
            State-->>Insight: State + freshness + evidence
        else Bounded refresh allowed
            State->>MCP: Certified metric query
            MCP-->>State: Values + provenance + freshness
            State->>State: Derive and persist state
            State-->>Insight: Refreshed state
        else Refresh outside latency budget
            State-->>Insight: STALE/UNAVAILABLE + last-valid timestamp
        end
        Insight->>Insight: Decision policy or health assembly
        Insight-->>Voice: Typed response + trace ID
        Voice->>Speech: Strict rendered text/SSML
        Speech-->>Edge: Audio
        Edge-->>Founder: Spoken answer
    end
